### Create a delivery (destination always fails with 503, so you can watch retries)
POST http://localhost:8080/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://httpbin.org/status/503",
  "eventType": "order.created",
  "payload": { "orderId": 42 }
}

> {% client.global.set("deliveryId", response.body.id); %}

### Inspect the delivery
GET http://localhost:8080/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}

### Invalid request (expect 400 with field errors)
POST http://localhost:8080/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "destinationUrl": "not-a-url", "eventType": "" }

### Unknown delivery (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/deliveries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000